Package: oochecksum
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: Sovereign HASH VERIFIER
 Unified integrity checking utility verifying BSD and GNU style checksum manifests.
 Pure openOODA utility with zero ambient authority, terminal ergonomics,
 and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
